New 2-bedroom apartment with 100,30 m² | Modernity, Comfort and Quality of Life

We present this elegant 2-bedroom apartment in a modern development currently under construction, ideal for anyone looking for a functional, comfortable home that is ready to meet the demands of everyday life.

With a total area of 100,30 m², this property stands out for its excellent layout and the natural light that fills the entire home.

The living area comprises a welcoming 21,40 m² living and dining room, providing a spacious, harmonious setting for spending time with family or entertaining friends. The living room has direct access to a pleasant balcony, shared with the kitchen, creating a seamless connection between the indoor and outdoor spaces.

The 9,60 m² kitchen will be delivered fully furnished and equipped, combining contemporary design, functionality and everyday comfort.

The entrance hall is equipped with a video intercom, enhancing the security and convenience of the home.

In the private area, the apartment comprises: 

 A 11,60 m² bedroom with a built-in wardrobe; 

 A full bathroom; 

 A comfortable en-suite bedroom with a built-in wardrobe, 

 En-suite bedroom with a built-in wardrobe, measuring 12,80 m²

 Bedroom hallway

 Fixtures and Finishes

 Furnished and equipped kitchen;

 Excellent natural light in the living room and kitchen;

 Balcony shared by the living room and kitchen;

 En-suite bedroom with a built-in wardrobe;

 Bedroom with a built-in wardrobe;

 Video intercom;

 Air conditioning;

 Electric shutters;

 Heat pump for domestic hot water;

 Thermally broken window frames with low-emissivity glass;

 Garage parking space;

 Lift.

This apartment has been designed to offer comfort, energy efficiency and quality of life, making it an excellent option both as a home and as an investment.

 Located just 1 km from the centre of Águeda, it is close to shops, services, schools and main access routes, while retaining the tranquillity of a residential area.

 Expected completion of construction: 2028.

